Changes: validated, normalized, filtered to reviewed geographic areas, rounded coordinates,
merged metadata by MMSI and bounded deterministic selection. Historical captures retain
original timestamps. Data may be incomplete, delayed or inaccurate; no accuracy or
availability warranty is implied. Not for navigation.

